单","content":"1) 必须为 Cube 让出 L1(512K)/L0A(64K)/L0B(64K)/L0C(128K)/UB(192K) 整块缓冲；2) L1TileShape 的 M/K/N 需 32B 对齐，RowMajor M 方向需 16 对齐，否则 static_assert 直接编译失败；3) 仅支持 CATLASS_ARCH=2201(AtlasA2) 或 3510，且 supported_npu 白名单不含 ascend910b。"},{"kind":"risk","title":"架构门控阻断集成","content":"目标器件若为 Ascend 910B，现有 CATLASS 构建与 supported_npu 白名单均无对应分支，无法直接以现有配置编译通过。"},{"kind":"test_command","title":"最小编译验证","content":"cmake -DCATLASS_ARCH=2201 -DNPU=<target> .. && cmake --build . —— 用于确认对齐断言与 arch 门控是否在目标工程触发。"},{"kind":"question","title":"目标器件确认","content":"工单目标 NPU 具体型号是 Atlas A2/A3/950 还是 910B？若为 910B，是否允许新增 CATLASS_ARCH 分支与 supported_npu 条目？"}],"examinedFiles":["Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/arch/arch.hpp","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/arch/resource.hpp","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/arch/local_tensor_buffer.hpp","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/dispatch_policy.hpp","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong_tla.hpp","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/helper.hpp","Ascend/catlass/CMakeLists.txt"],"risks":["CATLASS_ARCH 门控仅识别 2201/3510，目标器件若为 ascend910b 将直接编译失败。","Resource 一次性整块占用 L1/L0A/L0B/L0C/UB，与宿主工程其它算子共存时存在缓冲冲突风险。","32B / 16 对齐为 static_assert 硬约束，非对齐形状无法通过降级绕过。","CANN >=8.5.0 为最低版本要求，低版本工具链下行为未验证。","arch 门控条件用 #if 包裹静态断言，若 CATLASS_ARCH 未定义，部分约束会被静默跳过，产生误通过。"],"nextActions":["确认目标 NPU 型号；若为 910B，评估新增 CATLASS_ARCH 分支与 supported_npu 白名单条目的工作量。","在目标工程执行最小编译验证（cmake -DCATLASS_ARCH=2201 + 构建），确认对齐断言是否触发并读取首个失败信息。","核对宿主工程已占用的 L1/L0A/L0B/L0C/UB 缓冲用量，评估与 CATLASS Resource 的共存可行性。","确认宿主 CANN 版本是否 >=8.5.0，否则先升级工具链再复测。","为 L1TileShape 选定满足 32B 对齐的 M/K/N 取值，并确认 RowMajor 下 M 方向为 16 的倍数。"],"evidenceStatus":"blocked"},{"workOrderId":"batch:0","objective":"拆解 CATLASS 高性能的根本机制（只读，不改任何文件）。仓库根：D:\\Desktop\\OP-Learning\\Ascend\\catlass。逐条回答，每条必须给 file:line 或命令 exit code 作为证据，拿不出证据就标「未验证」： 1) 分层抽象的职责边界：Kernel / Block / Tile / Epilogue 各层负责什么、层间接口形状是什么？关键头文件与行号。 2) 流水线机制：pingpong、双缓冲、Mutex 同步原语、事件配对（Set/WaitFlag）如何实现？逐个给出文件:行号。特别看 include/catlass/gemm/block/blo…","status":"passed","summary":"Catlass GEMM 四层结构（Device/Kernel/Block/Tile）的职责边界、层间绑定方式、pingpong 与 Mutex 两代流水线同步机制、多 buffer 级数约束及架构特化路径均已通过代码走查逐条指认并落到 file:line 证据。","findings":[{"claim":"四层职责边界可完整指认，且层间绑定是编译期模板偏特化而非运行期虚函数：Device 只负责启动、Kernel 负责切块调度、Block 负责单 C 块的 K 轴循环与三级搬运同步、Tile 负责不可再分的搬运原语装配。","evidence":"device_gemm.hpp:78,80,83 为 KernelAdapter<GemmKernel><<<blockDim,nullptr,stream>>>；basic_matmul.hpp:33 模板参数为 BlockMmad_,BlockEpilogue_,BlockScheduler_，:125 为 for(loopIdx=GetBlockIdx();loopIdx<coreLoops;loopIdx+=GetBlockNum())；block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:186-188 为 operator()(gmA,layoutA,gmB,layoutB,gmC,layoutC,GemmCoord)；tile_copy.hpp:47-62 定义 struct TileCopy 及 :53-57 五个搬运别名；block_mmad.hpp:49-51 主模板体为 static_assert(DEPENDENT_FALSE<DispatchPolicy>) 报错体。","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/device/device_gemm.hpp:78","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/kernel/basic_matmul.hpp:125","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:186","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/tile/tile_copy.hpp:53","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad.hpp:49"]},{"claim":"pingpong 版流水线用 AscendC HardEvent 成对 Set/Wait 实现：构造期预置全部事件、K 轴循环内做 pingpong 轮转、L1→L0 与 MMAD 之间用 MTE1_M 双向握手、末轮用 UnitFlag 0b11 收尾。","evidence":"block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:161-176 构造期对各 stage 调 SetFlag<MTE1_MTE2> 与 SetFlag<M_MTE1>；:255-277 下一块 A/B 的 WaitFlag<MTE1_MTE2>→copyGmToL1A/B→SetFlag<MTE2_MTE1>；:288-305 L1→L0A 的 WaitFlag<M_MTE1> 与 WaitFlag<MTE2_MTE1> 加 copyL1ToL0A；:313 SetFlag<MTE1_M>、:322 WaitFlag<MTE1_M>；:332-341 unitFlag 中间轮 0b10 末轮 0b11、:343 tileMmad(...,initC,unitFlag)；:355-357 SetFlag<M_FIX>→WaitFlag<M_FIX>→copyL0CToGm。","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:161","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:255","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:288","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:313","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:343","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:355"]},{"claim":"Ascend950 的 Mutex 版把块内同步整体从 HardEvent 换轨为 Mutex::Lock/Unlock，同一文件内不存在任何 SetFlag/WaitFlag/HardEvent 调用；该换轨是有意为之而非观测遗漏，因为同一 grep pattern 在同文件内命中了 unitFlag 变量名。","evidence":"block_mmad_pingpong_mutex_tla.hpp:287-289 为 Mutex::Lock<PIPE_MTE2>(l1AMutexList[id])→copyGmToL1A→Mutex::Unlock<PIPE_MTE2>，:295-297、:307-309、:315-317、:325 为同构模式，:485 为 Unlock<PIPE_M>(L0_BIAS_MUTEX_ID)；以 pattern SetFlag|WaitFlag|HardEvent 在该文件 grep 得零命中，而以 pattern Flag|SetFlag|WaitFlag|HardEvent 命中 unitFlag 于 :108、:464、:468。","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong_mutex_tla.hpp:287","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong_mutex_tla.hpp:485","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong_mutex_tla.hpp:464"]},{"claim":"多 buffer 级数由 DispatchPolicy 与各存储级 stage 数共同决定，且受 L1/L0 容量 static_assert 硬约束；Mutex 版另有 MutexID 0~27 的独立上限。","evidence":"block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:44-69 DispatchStagesGetter 取 L1_STAGES=min(L1A,L1B)、L0_STAGES=min(L0A,L0B)、STAGES=min(L1,L0)；dispatch_policy.hpp:32-35 MmadAtlasA2Pingpong 的 STAGES=2；block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:125 static_assert(L1A_SIZE*STAGES+L1B_SIZE*STAGES<=L1_SIZE) 与 :135-137 的 L0 三条 static_assert；block_mmad_pingpong_mutex_tla.hpp:142 static_assert(TOTAL_MUTEX_IDS<=28)。","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:64","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:125","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/dispatch_policy.hpp:32","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong_mutex_tla.hpp:142"]},{"claim":"硬件层级特化通过两代容量表加架构条件 include 实现：容量常量被 static_assert 消费，搬运实现按 CATLASS_ARCH 宏转发到不同子目录。","evidence":"arch.hpp:18-26 AtlasA2 含 UB_SIZE=192*1024、L1_SIZE=512*1024、L0A/L0B=64*1024、L0C=128*1024；:29-37 Ascend950 含 UB_SIZE=248*1024、L1_SIZE=512*1024、L0C=256*1024；resource.hpp:24-29 定义 l1Buf/l0ABuf/l0BBuf/l0CBuf/ubBuf 对应 TPosition A1/A2/B2/CO1/VECCALC；tile/copy_gm_to_l1.hpp:16-24 仅在 CATLASS_ARCH==2201/3510 时 include atlasa2/ 或 ascend950/ 子文件。","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/arch/arch.hpp:18","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/arch/arch.hpp:29","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/arch/resource.hpp:24","Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/tile/copy_gm_to_l1.hpp:16"]},{"claim":"Cube 与 Vector 的分工在代码里体现为：BlockMmad 内部无任何 AIV 分支，GM→L0C 通路由 AIC 独占；ASCEND_IS_AIV 仅出现在 epilogue/block 目录下，即后处理与重排在 Vector 侧独立执行。","evidence":"basic_matmul.hpp:144-146 的 operator()<AscendC::AIV>(Params const&) 为空实现；以 pattern ASCEND_IS_AIV|ASCEND_IS_AIC 在 include/catlass 全量 grep，命中集中在 epilogue/block/block 路径，BlockMmad 相关文件零命中。","confidence":"medium","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/kernel/basic_matmul.hpp:144"]}],"artifacts":[{"kind":"note","title":"四层结构概览","content":"Device(GemmAdapter/启动核函数) → Kernel(BasicMatmul：切块、coreLoops 调度、AIV/AIC 分派) → Block(BlockMmad/BlockEpilogue：单 C 块的 K 轴循环+三级搬运同步) → Tile(TileCopy/TileMmad：不可再分搬运与计算原语)。层间通过模板参数注入，无运行期多态。"},{"kind":"note","title":"同步机制两代对照","content":"AtlasA2 路线使用 AscendC HardEvent（SetFlag/WaitFlag<MTE1_MTE2|MTE2_MTE1|MTE1_M|M_FIX>）成对握手；Ascend950 路线使用 Mutex::Lock/Unlock<PIPE_*> 配 MutexID 表，受 TOTAL_MUTEX_IDS<=28 约束。两者都在构造期或首次迭代预置状态。"},{"kind":"risk","title":"UnitFlag 末轮收尾","content":"末轮 unitFlag=0b11 与中间轮 0b10 的差异只体现在 tileMmad 入参，无显式 assert 保护，回归时易被误改。"},{"kind":"test_command","title":"证据复现 grep","content":"rg -n \"SetFlag|WaitFlag|HardEvent\" Ascend/catlass/include/catlass/gemm/block/block_mmad_pingpong_mutex_tla.hpp  # 期望零命中"},{"kind":"question","title":"Mutex 版为何缺 M_FIX 等价物","content":"block_mmad_pingpong.hpp:355-357 用 SetFlag/WaitFlag<M_FIX> 保护 L0C→GM，Mutex 版对应位置改为 Unlock<PIPE_M>(L0_BIAS_MUTEX_ID)，需